  "description": "Use this skill for Elfa API crypto social intelligence and Auto condition-engine workflows: API v3 events, calendar, positions and rankings (crypto, equities), Verify (check a claim against X, Telegram and the web), Monitors (a topic in plain words, a signed webhook per match), trending tokens, narratives, mentions, token news, trending contract addresses, AI market chat (JSON and SSE streaming), curl/code snippets, automated alerts, EQL queries, trigger pipelines, and agent workflows that react to market conditions. Auto can trigger on X/Twitter posts, Telegram channels, events (news), one trader's calls, token or stock mindshare, SEC filings, Kalshi and Polymarket prediction markets, funding rates, liquidation cascades, the Fear & Greed index, and X follow-graph moves, run recurring plans (`repeat`, `cron.schedule`), and monitor crypto plus HIP-3 assets (equities, indices, commodities, FX, pre-IPO — 24/7). Supports API keys and x402 pay-per-request in USDC on six networks, or USDT on BNB Smart Chain.",
